<title>AUSTRALIA: CommBank appoints risk management chief.</title>
<headline>CommBank appoints risk management chief.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1997-08-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Commonwealth Bank of Australia said on Friday it had appointed Michael Ullmer to head its group financial and risk management activities.</p>
<p>Ullmer is currently chairman of Coopers and Lybrand's national financial services group and Asian banking group.</p>
<p>-- Sydney Newsroom 61-2 9373 1800</p>
</text>
